Adds Palomar/comparator-bowen-chapman.json to PALOMAR_PENDING_CONFIGS and
SURFACE_FILES, four calibrations with planters, BowenChapman in the pending
statement-match loop, and the palomar-check paths, build targets and axiom step.
Before landing: apply in the shared campaign clone on MSI and run
`python3 scripts/check_palomar_submission.py --self-test` and the plain gate
(never locally); then land as origin blob plus these hunks, rebuilt on fresh blobs.

